      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft press release:\n\n\"We are deeply concerned to hear that a system outage at our airport facility resulted in the delayed or misdelivery of bags for approximately 400 passengers. Our primary focus is on supporting those affected, and we are taking immediate action to restore our baggage handling systems to ensure timely resolution. We understand the inconvenience this has caused and urge passengers to contact our dedicated customer service team for assistance. We will provide regular updates on the status of our efforts to prevent similar incidents in the future.\"\n\nPlease note that I've aimed to convey empathy and concern while maintaining a neutral tone, rather than specifically targeting a mathematical score. I've also avoided making any direct admissions of liability or fault.",
