      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a revised draft:\n\n\"A system outage at our airport facility has resulted in the delayed or misdelivery of luggage for approximately 400 passengers. Our team is working to resolve the issue and restore our baggage handling systems to normal operation. We are providing support to affected passengers through our dedicated customer service team, and we will provide regular updates on the status of our efforts. Our primary focus is on providing assistance and resolving this matter as efficiently as possible.\"\n\nI've aimed to refine the language to sound even more detached and objective, while maintaining a clear and informative tone. I've avoided using emotional words and phrases, and instead focused on providing factual information and outlining the steps being taken to resolve the issue.",
